stream
BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (HX-DOCK-4 Docking Station Guide) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Document ID: prod-halcyon-docking-station-guide | Revision: B | Effective: 2025-06-20 | Owner:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 688 Td (Halcyon Product Engineering, Leeds) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 663 Td (1. Overview) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 641 Td (The HX-DOCK-4 is a four-bay docking station for the Halcyon family of portable gas detectors.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (It automatically charges, bump tests and calibrates instruments, sets their real-time clock,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (updates their firmware and downloads their datalogs. Results are stored on the dock and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (synchronised to Meridian Link on a connected PC.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 580 Td (The HX-DOCK-4 accepts the HX-210 and HX-220 directly. The HX-200 must first be fitted into the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 567 Td (HX-ADP-200 adapter, which positions its smaller housing over the gas ports and charging) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (contacts. Up to four instruments of any mix can be docked at the same time.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 532 Td (The docking station is not certified for use in hazardous areas. Install it in a safe area) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 519 Td (only.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 494 Td (2. Installation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 472 Td (1. Place the dock on a level bench or mount it on a wall using the four keyhole slots \(M5) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 459 Td (   screws, not supplied\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 446 Td (2. Connect the 24 V DC power supply \(supplied, part number HX-PSU-24\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 433 Td (3. Connect the calibration gas cylinder to the GAS IN port using the demand-flow regulator) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 420 Td (   MI-REG-DF. The dock controls flow internally; do not use a fixed-flow regulator on the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 407 Td (   dock. Inlet pressure must be between 0.5 and 1.0 bar.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 394 Td (4. Connect a vent hose \(maximum 10 m\) from the EXHAUST port to a safe area.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 381 Td (5. Connect the dock to a PC with the USB-C cable, or to the site network using the Ethernet) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 368 Td (   port. The Ethernet port uses DHCP by default.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 355 Td (6. Install Meridian Link 4.2 or later on the PC and add the dock with Docks > Add Dock.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 339 Td (3. Gas configuration) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 317 Td (Configure the cylinder in Meridian Link under Docks > [dock] > Cylinders. For HX-210 and HX-220) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 304 Td (instruments on firmware 3.4.1 or later, the cylinder must be MI-CAL-Q4-B \(1.1% vol CH4, 18.0%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 291 Td (O2, 50 ppm CO, 15 ppm H2S\). For HX-200 instruments, a second gas inlet \(GAS IN 2\) can be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 278 Td (connected to MI-CAL-H2S25. The dock selects the correct inlet automatically based on the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 265 Td (instrument model.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 243 Td (The dock warns when a cylinder is within 30 days of expiry and refuses to use an expired) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 230 Td (cylinder.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 205 Td (4. Operation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 183 Td (When an instrument is docked, the bay LED shows its status:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 161 Td (- Blue: charging) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 148 Td (- Flashing yellow: bump test or calibration in progress) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 135 Td (- Green: test passed, instrument charged) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 122 Td (- Red: test failed or instrument fault) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 109 Td (The dock performs whichever action is due according to the policy set in Meridian Link \(Docks >) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 96 Td ([dock] > Policy\). The default policy is: bump test on every docking if the last bump test is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 83 Td (more than 20 hours old; calibrate when the calibration is due within 7 days; download datalogs;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 70 Td (synchronise the clock.) Tj ET
endstream
