BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (A bump test in the dock takes about 60 seconds. A calibration takes about 4 minutes for an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (HX-210 or HX-220 and about 3 minutes for an HX-200.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 691 Td (5. Firmware compatibility) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 669 Td (The dock firmware must be compatible with the instrument firmware. Update the dock before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 656 Td (updating instruments.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 635 Td (Dock firmware | HX-200 firmware supported | HX-210 / HX-220 firmware supported | Notes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 623 Td (D-1.9.x | 3.2.0 to 3.2.2 | up to 3.3.x | End of support 31 March 2025) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 611 Td (D-2.0.x | 3.2.0 to 3.2.4 | up to 3.4.0 | Cannot calibrate instruments on 3.4.1 or later) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 599 Td (D-2.1.0 | 3.2.0 to 3.2.4 | 3.3.0 to 3.4.2 | Required for MI-CAL-Q4-B presets and 120-day HX-210) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 587 Td (interval) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 565 Td (To update the dock, select Docks > [dock] > Firmware > Check for Updates in Meridian Link. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 552 Td (update takes about 8 minutes, during which the bays are disabled. Do not disconnect power.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 527 Td (6. Maintenance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 505 Td (- Replace the inlet filter HX-FLT-D4 every 12 months.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 492 Td (- Check the bay gaskets monthly for cracks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 479 Td (- Leak-test the gas path every 6 months using Docks > [dock] > Service > Leak Test. The test) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 466 Td (   fails if pressure drops by more than 5 mbar in 60 seconds.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 450 Td (7. Troubleshooting) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 429 Td (Symptom | Action) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 417 Td (Bay LED red, instrument shows E-104 | Check that the cylinder is MI-CAL-Q4-B and in date; see) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 405 Td (sup-halcyon-error-codes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 393 Td (Instrument not recognised | Clean the charging contacts; for HX-200 check the HX-ADP-200) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 381 Td (adapter is seated) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 369 Td ("FW INCOMPATIBLE" on dock display | Update dock firmware to D-2.1.0) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 357 Td (Dock not found in Meridian Link | Check USB-C cable or DHCP lease; the dock also answers on) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 345 Td (169.254.10.4 if no DHCP server is found) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 320 Td (8. Specifications) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 299 Td (Parameter | Value) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 287 Td (Bays | 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 275 Td (Compatible instruments | HX-210, HX-220; HX-200 with HX-ADP-200) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 263 Td (Power | 24 V DC, 60 W \(HX-PSU-24\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 251 Td (Gas inlets | 2, demand flow, 0.5 to 1.0 bar) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 239 Td (Connectivity | USB-C, Ethernet 10/100) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 227 Td (Storage | 10,000 test records) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 215 Td (Operating temperature | 0 to +40 C) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 203 Td (Dimensions | 420 x 190 x 150 mm) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 191 Td (Weight | 3.4 kg) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 179 Td (Current dock firmware | D-2.1.0) Tj ET
endstream
